Local patch 0104 (qwen3.6-35b-a3b-exl3-tensorfold): Qwen3.6 MoE kept states to the prompt store on disk.

Needs 0006 (cuda/prompt_store.py). qwen3_5_moe/cuda/disk_points.py saves each kept entry of MultiDecoder.cache
(attention rows in shared 1024-row blocks, DeltaNet rec/conv states, MTP head rows, held hidden rows) and loads the
longest stored point a prompt extends into the kept entries when that beats prefilling from the GPU's own longest.
Hooks in multi.py: admit (restore + pin count), _add (capture), warm (store off). Off unless TF_PROMPT_CACHE_DIR set.
Test: tests/test_qwen36_prompt_store.py (CPU).

